BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:JIBBOOM Club #1
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260721
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
DTSTAMP:20261019T171955Z
UID:e8342fcee380cc1515c66d1b17b8@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Jibboom is not a club—it's a welcoming gathering for anyone 
 who enjoys Connecticut's rich maritime heritage. Join us on the third Tues
 day of each month\, now through December\, at 1:30 p.m. for an engaging pr
 esentation by a maritime speaker\, followed by light refreshments and frie
 ndly conversation. Bring a friend and discover something new. Admission is
  free\, thanks to the generous sponsorship of Rose & Joe Maco.\n\nSource: 
 https://ctvisit.com/events/jibboom-club-1
LOCATION:Custom House Maritime Museum\, Custom House Maritime Museum\, 150
  Bank Street\, New London CT\, 06320
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/jibboom-club-1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Open Mic at the Custom House Maritime Museum
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
DTSTAMP:20261019T171955Z
UID:0d87efb1ef8bf41cf100a558adc3@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Come for the creativity\, stay for the camaraderie. Our monthl
 y Open Mic is all about good vibes and real connection. Hosted by Kenny 'D
 oc' Frasier\, it’s a welcoming space for music\, poetry\, prose\, stand-
 up—or just saying what’s on your mind. This is a laid-back\, live show
  where anyone can show up and share a few minutes on the mic. Try out new 
 material\, build your confidence\, or just soak in the energy—it’s all
  fair game. And there are cookies! All ages\, all abilities are welcome.\n
 \nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/open-mic-custom-house-maritime-museum
LOCATION:Custom House Maritime Museum\, Custom House Maritime Museum\, 150
  Bank Street\, New London CT\, 06320
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/open-mic-custom-house-maritime-museum
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Connecticut Renaissance Faire
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260829
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTSTAMP:20261019T171955Z
UID:82091beb6910ab41632e6d6404ee@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Connecticut Renaissance Faire returns to the Lebanon Fairg
 rounds from August 29 through October 25\, 2026\, running every Saturday a
 nd Sunday plus Labor Day and Columbus Day. Nine weekends and two holiday M
 ondays of full-contact jousting\, artisan markets\, live entertainment\, p
 eriod food and drink\, and the kind of spectacle that draws tens of thousa
 nds to Lebanon each fall. Each weekend runs on its own distinct theme: Dra
 gons & Dungeons\, Faerie Ring Revels\, Pirates & Vikings\, Shirefolk\, and
  five others. New shows\, new shops\, changing menus. It's not the same fa
 ire twice.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/connecticut-renaissance-f
 aire-2
LOCATION:Lebanon Fairgrounds\, 122 Mack Road\, Lebanon CT\, 06249
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/connecticut-renaissance-faire-2
END:VEVENT
