SUMMARY:Bank Square Books Presents Peter King in Conversation with Jeff Be
 nedict
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTSTAMP:20261019T171955Z
UID:06123219473957f0ee540bf462e4@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Peter King will be joined in conversation by bestselling autho
 r Jeff Benedict\, offering audiences an engaging discussion on the NFL’s
