 tion\, we quickly access the benefits of a deep meditation practice\, with
 out needing any experience or special techniques. Attendants will experien
 ce a live sound journey\, finding stillness through the orchestration\, al
 lowing a deep connection to the space within one’s heart\, mind and body
 . As the vibrations gently hold us\, we are able to release mental and emo
 tional blockages\, and invite & strengthen a connection with our highest s
 elf.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/sound-meditation-concert-yoga-s
 hop-east-16
LOCATION:The Yoga Shop of Glastonbury\, 122 Naubuc Ave\, 2nd Floor\, Glast
 onbury CT\, 06033
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/sound-meditation-concert-yoga-shop-east-16
END:VEVENT
